  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5cde1b43988bda44d87bc8d50ff224e6, type: 3}
  m_Name: CitizensWarMemorialChoir
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  recording: {fileID: 0}
  teaser: "You are listening to the real recording of the choir \u2014 know more"
  detailTitle: Choir, worship and remembrance
  detailBody: 'At memorial services, a choir can give a community a shared voice.
    Hymns and choral music connect the words of a service with familiar rituals of
    gathering, reflection and remembrance.


    For many people, singing together
    is part of how faith and community are practised: voices carry prayers, mark
    moments of silence, and offer comfort to those remembering loved ones. The sound
    can hold personal memories as well as public history.


    As you listen here,
    consider what this place means to the people who gather at the memorial, and
    how music helps a community remember.'
